our clinician interprets results in the context of your symptoms and history.","vec":{"read":0.278861,"lab":0.385857,"result":0.393023,"report":0.183863,"list":0.140558,"each":0.151104,"test":0.140558,"reference":0.183863,"range":0.255841,"value":0.183863,"outside":0.183863,"automatically":0.183863,"problem":0.140558,"because":0.183863,"rang":0.183863,"vary":0.1647,"between":0.183863,"laboratory":0.183863,"people":0.151104,"clinician":0.082721,"interpret":0.183863,"context":0.183863,"symptom":0.124656,"history":0.1647}},{"id":"EDU-21","title":"Taking medicines safely","text":"Take medicines exactly as directed on the label or by your clinician, keep them in their original containers, and do not share them. Tell your pharmacist about all other medicines and supplements you use. Missing doses or stopping early can reduce how well a treatment works, so ask your clinician if you are unsure.","vec":{"tak":0.322425,"medicin":0.292493,"safely":0.322425,"take":0.170583,"exactly":0.19043,"direct":0.19043,"label":0.19043,"clinician":0.145061,"keep":0.116807,"original":0.19043,"container":0.19043,"share":0.19043,"pharmacist":0.19043,"all":0.156501,"other":0.129108,"supplement":0.170583,"use":0.170583,"miss":0.170583,"dos":0.170583,"stopp":0.156501,"early":0.136654,"reduce":0.19043,"well":0.170583,"treatment":0.19043,"work":0.170583,"ask":0.145578,"unsure":0.19043}},{"id":"EDU-22","title":"Medication adherence tips","text":"Pill organisers, phone reminders and linking doses to daily routines such as brushing teeth can help you remember medicines. If side effects bother you, talk to your clinician instead of stopping on your own.","vec":{"medication":0.33336,"adherence":0.33336,"tip":0.33336,"pill":0.196888,"organiser":0.196888,"phone":0.176368,"reminder":0.196888,"link":0.196888,"dos":0.176368,"daily":0.161808,"routin":0.176368,"such":0.115436,"brush":0.196888,"teeth":0.196888,"remember":0.196888,"medicin":0.126729,"side":0.196888,"effect":0.196888,"bother":0.196888,"talk":0.16