asurement matters. Lifestyle steps such as less salt, regular activity and healthy weight support blood pressure control, and some people also need medicines.","vec":{"hypertension":0.430192,"overview":0.285238,"mean":0.204989,"blood":0.223399,"pressure":0.235312,"stay":0.138979,"higher":0.183624,"recommend":0.183624,"often":0.147101,"symptom":0.138979,"measurement":0.156708,"matter":0.204989,"lifestyle":0.183624,"step":0.204989,"such":0.120185,"les":0.204989,"salt":0.183624,"regular":0.125737,"activity":0.147101,"healthy":0.156708,"weight":0.156708,"support":0.125737,"control":0.183624,"some":0.168466,"people":0.168466,"need":0.125737,"medicin":0.131943}},{"id":"EDU-26","title":"Back pain","text":"Back pain is very common and usually improves over a few weeks. Staying gently active, avoiding long periods in one position and good lifting technique can help. See a clinician if pain follows an injury, is severe, spreads down a leg, or comes with numbness or weakness.","vec":{"back":0.37043,"pain":0.421209,"very":0.158115,"common":0.126666,"usually":0.158115,"improv":0.158115,"over":0.126666,"few":0.158115,"week":0.158115,"stay":0.119672,"gently":0.158115,"active":0.158115,"avoid":0.126666,"long":0.126666,"period":0.158115,"one":0.145063,"position":0.176512,"good":0.158115,"lift":0.176512,"technique":0.176512,"see":0.158115,"clinician":0.079414,"follow":0.134938,"injury":0.158115,"severe":0.134938,"spread":0.158115,"down":0.158115,"leg":0.176512,"com":0.176512,"numbnes":0.176512,"weaknes":0.176512}},{"id":"EDU-27","title":"Skin care basics","text":"Daily sun protection, gentle cleansing and moisturising support healthy skin. Dry or itchy skin conditions such as eczema often need regular moisturiser. Any mole that changes in size, shape or colour should be checked by a clinician.","vec":{"skin":0.452298,"care":0.206563,"basic":0.263741,"daily":0.15577,"sun":0.18954,"protection":0.18954,"gentle":0.18954,"cleans":0.18954,"moisturis":0.18954,"support":0.116261,"healthy":0.