ng, sleep, behaviour or milestones. Keeping the child health record handy at each visit is helpful.","vec":{"child":0.463678,"health":0.284413,"check":0.335125,"regular":0.119186,"track":0.194309,"growth":0.194309,"development":0.194309,"vaccination":0.159689,"parent":0.174058,"encourag":0.174058,"raise":0.194309,"any":0.174058,"concern":0.174058,"feed":0.194309,"sleep":0.148544,"behaviour":0.194309,"mileston":0.194309,"keep":0.119186,"record":0.139438,"handy":0.194309,"each":0.159689,"visit":0.131738,"helpful":0.174058}},{"id":"EDU-31","title":"Your health records and privacy","text":"Your health information is personal. Clinicians should only access the records they need to provide your care. You can ask which information is stored about you and who can see it. Use strong, unique passwords and avoid sharing your login.","vec":{"health":0.267494,"record":0.312945,"privacy":0.351839,"information":0.351839,"personal":0.186144,"clinician":0.093491,"only":0.207802,"acces":0.207802,"need":0.127462,"provide":0.207802,"care":0.133754,"ask":0.158858,"stor":0.207802,"see":0.186144,"use":0.186144,"strong":0.207802,"unique":0.207802,"password":0.207802,"avoid":0.14912,"shar":0.207802,"login":0.207802}},{"id":"EDU-32","title":"Rescheduling and cancelling appointments","text":"If you cannot attend an appointment, cancel or reschedule as early as you can so that the slot can be offered to someone else. Missing appointments without notice can delay your own care and that of other patients.","vec":{"reschedul":0.344337,"cancell":0.344337,"appointment":0.398836,"cannot":0.203371,"attend":0.182175,"cancel":0.203371,"reschedule":0.203371,"early":0.14594,"slot":0.203371,"offer":0.203371,"someone":0.182175,"else":0.203371,"miss":0.182175,"without":0.203371,"notice":0.203371,"delay":0.203371,"own":0.182175,"care":0.130902,"other":0.137882,"patient":0.203371}},{"id":"EDU-33","title":"First aid for minor cuts and burns","text":"For a minor cut, wash your hands, press gently with a clean cloth to stop bleeding, rinse with clean water and cover with a clean dressing. For a minor burn, cool it under cool running water for about twenty minutes and do not apply butter or ice. Seek help for deep, large or infected wounds.","vec":{"first":0.242353,"aid":0.242353,"minor":0.305969,"cut":0.30039,"burn":0.30039,"wash":0.128219,"hand":0.128219,"pres":0.143138,"gently":0.128219,"clean":0.30039,"cloth":0.143138,"stop":0.143138,"bleed":0.143138,"rinse":0.143138,"water":0.199173,"cover":0.128219,"dress":0.143138,"cool":0.242353,"under":0.143138,"runn":0.143138,"twenty":0.128219,"minut":0.117635,"apply":0.143138,"butter":0.143138,"ice":0.143138,"seek":0.128219,"deep":0.143138,"large":0.143138,"infect":0.143138,"wound":0.143138}},{"id":"EDU-34","title":"Quitting smoking","text":"Stopping smoking benefits nearly every part of the body and improves quickly. Support such as counselling, nicotine replacement and set quit dates increases the chance of success. A clinician can talk through the options that suit you.","vec":{"quitt":0.333202,"smok":0.369952,"stopp":0.161732,"benefit":0.196794,"nearly":0.196794,"every":0.176284,"part":0.176284,"body":0.133423,"improv":0.176284,"quickly":0.196794,"support":0.120711,"such":0.115381,"counsell":0.196794,"nicotine":0.196794,"replacement":0.196794,"set":0.196794,"quit":0.196794,"dat":0.196794,"increas":0.176284,"chance":0.161732,"succes":0.196794,"clinician":0.088539,"talk":0.161732,"through":0.196794,"option":0.196794,"suit":0.176284}},{"id":"EDU-35","title":"Healthy ageing","text":"Staying active, eating well, keeping social connections, attending screening and managing long-term conditions all support healthy ageing. Falls prevention, such as keeping floors clear and wearing supportive footwear, is also important.","vec":{"healthy":0.319383,"age":0.417783,"stay":0.13497,"active":0.178328,"eat":0.142858,"well":0.178328,"keep":0.20675,"social":0.199076,"connection":0.178328,"attend":0.178328,"screen":0.152188,"manag":0.178328,"lo